msgid "CodeCombat"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The CodeCombat website, where you learn Python and JavaScript by playing. It "
"needs the internet and a CodeCombat account, paid for most of it; Kidux is "
"not connected with CodeCombat."
msgstr ""

msgid "Email"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The email address of the child's CodeCombat account. Empty, the child signs "
"in on the site."
msgstr ""

msgid "Password"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The password of the child's CodeCombat account. Kidux signs in with it, and "
"the child never sees it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Connecting to CodeCombat…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"I could not sign in to CodeCombat: the email or the password is not right. "
"Ask an adult to check your account."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"CodeCombat does not answer. Check that the internet works, or try again in a "
"while."
msgstr ""

msgid "Try again"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"No CodeCombat account is set for you yet. The easiest is for an adult to put "
"it in CodeCombat's Settings on the adult panel. Until then, you can sign in "
"yourself:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sign in myself"
msgstr ""
